FO_bKyTwKk0VrY9VqrWowwfFXNbWcl8g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7GRHbIelxXPd79I53IFTTgnpRUhSJwIFZvxCfnUpFHsg&oe=6A11B1ED"}, {"file_name": "StoryMode.png", "id": "32811313745133632", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618297_32811313751800298_6861778986600558374_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K4jd47SYpSgQ7kNvwHHN94w&_nc_oc=Adq1hIz-C_O9tWRtW-lpInDcZMUDYJR9lTPt7aCUTDIF_Zw8z4QvG4QT1Up0MV9F1xo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af60wNEQQjT8u5risT6ZGThELN353_B99b31_WHHsDAS_g&oe=6A11B237"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "GameThumbnail.png", "id": "864108156302774", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619685_864108159636107_8140054702670079169_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ngG7gdRHSUQQ7kNvwGc8xVd&_nc_oc=AdqLr1IsqxI5svg9Tpm1OCdgEzsrbl0zq_yuKzom9KqiTFeondyLVKCiYnSEDixrVI4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af46Wqb922Jp-Sgx2eSxt1M2k-UHXIjqbe2q4Z2OT3yE6A&oe=6A11C26C"}, "display_name": "Novalight", "keywords": ["Story", "Gamemodes", "Space", "Robots", "Adventure"], "long_description": "# Welcome to Novalight!\n\nNovalight is a free-to-play, hand-based movement multiplayer game that takes place thousands of years into the future where humans have gone extinct after a failed experiment caused the earth to explode.\n\n{2872839186238379}\n\n# Choose Your Own Path:\n\nJoin up to **20 players** in a public server or create a private one with friends!\n\nPlay through either the **Story Mode, Gamemodes** or perhaps just hangout & chat with friends in the lobby.\n\n{2244974466007548}\n\n# Customization:\n\nYou can customize your character with a wide variety of cosmetics!\n\nand may purchase them with **Nebulite** in the store!\nthere are many customization options in this game so you'll be able to create a great outfit and show it off to others!\n\nYou may also sele